========================================================================
The two forms are BIT-IDENTICAL on every weight set tested, including the
constructed case where 100% of adjacent arrival pairs are exactly tied and
the tie-break alone decides the permutation. Every intermediate, both
forwards, and the gradient of all 8 parameters agree to 0.000e+00.

The sort spelling therefore cannot be the source of the c50-vs-c36 residual,
and the exact-sort ablation can only reproduce c50 seed for seed.

This ran on CPU, but the argument carries to GPU: the `rank` form applies
the permutation as an elementwise multiply followed by a sum over N, NOT a
dot_general, so no TF32 matmul path is involved and the reduction is a sum
of 16 exact zeros and one exact value -- reassociation-invariant.
